ials and secrets. After uploading, select Start build.", "在“镜像与构建”中登记和选择固定版本。此处也可填写本机镜像标签；修改标签会取消应用目标版本的固定。": "Register and select a pinned version in Images & builds. Entering a different local tag here removes the target version pin.", "在应用侧使用这些编号连接已有配置。应用任务仍需明确传入工作区；默认查看项目仅用于此管理界面。": "Legacy clients can connect using these IDs. Tasks must specify a workspace; the viewing default applies only to this interface.", "复用现有配置与会话，只增加应用归属信息。": "Reuse existing settings and conversations, adding only application ownership metadata.", "容器曾因内存不足被终止，请检查任务用量和内存配额。": "The container was terminated due to insufficient memory. Review usage and memory limits.", "尚无项目环境。选择镜像后，到运行环境中添加项目。": "No project environments. Select an image, then add a project in Runtime.", "尚未创建": "Not created", "尚未连接 Docker": "Docker not connected", "已保存：默认模型用于新会话，权限在下一轮生效": "Saved. The default model applies to new conversations; permissions apply from the next turn.", "已复制当前项目的接入信息": "Project connection details copied", "已复制接入信息": "Connection details copied", "已暂停": "Paused", "已有环境继续使用已保存的镜像与资源配置。更新只作用于选定环境；运行中的任务会阻止重建。": "Existing environments keep their saved image and resource settings. Updates affect only the selected environment; active tasks block recreation.", "应用不存在，请刷新列表": "Application not found. Refresh the list.", "应用所选能力": "Application capabilities", "应用目标版本已保存": "Application target version saved", "当前 CODEX_HOME：": "Current CODEX_HOME:", "当前已读取": "Loaded so far", "当前项目环境使用独立认证，下方提供容器登录命令。": "This project environment uses separate authentication. Container sign-in commands are below.", "待更新 · 当前继续使用原版本及资源配置，可在镜像与构建页查看目标版本。": "Update available. The current image and resources remain active. Review the target in Images & builds.", "技能、MCP、认证与原生记忆在每个项目环境中独立保存。停止和重建只允许在任务空闲时执行。空闲回收保留数据，请定期备份并按业务需要清理。": "Skills, MCP, authentication and native history are separate per project environment. Stop and recreate only when idle. Idle cleanup preserves data; back up and manage retained files regularly.", "按标