her applications remain administrator-managed.", "撤销这个凭据？已接收的任务和定时规则会保留。": "Revoke this credential? Accepted tasks and schedules will remain.", "此凭据只显示一次。请保存到应用服务器的环境变量或秘密配置。": "This credential is shown once. Store it in the application server's environment or secret configuration.", "使用 Authorization: Bearer <凭据> 调用 /api/v1。关闭后不能找回原值，可以撤销并新建。": "Call /api/v1 with Authorization: Bearer <credential>. Once closed, the original cannot be recovered; revoke and replace it if needed.", "历史应用 · ": "Legacy application · ", "已归档 · ": "Archived · ", "通用助手（历史任务共享；保存会影响通用助手）": "General assistant (shared legacy tasks; changes affect the assistant)", " · 构建": " · Builds", " 字节；最多保留 4 MiB。日志由构建脚本输出，可能包含敏感信息。": " bytes; maximum retained log size is 4 MiB. Build output may contain sensitive information.", "协作管理目前仅向管理员开放。密钥使用服务端环境变量，不写入页面。": "Collaboration management is administrator-only. Secrets use server environment variables and are not stored in the page.", " · 自动来自应用管理": " · Automatically registered from Applications", "补充要求或回答负责人。等待输入时会自动继续；暂停时请点击“继续”。": "Add instructions or answer the coordinator. Waiting tasks resume automatically; paused tasks require Continue.", "在远程服务确认该请求的任务 ID，避免重复提交。": "Confirm this request's task ID on the remote service to avoid duplicate submissions.", "现有 /api 接口继续兼容。应用可使用独立凭据，绑定应用与允许访问的项目；凭据在应用页面管理。": "Legacy /api remains compatible. Applications can use scoped credentials managed on their application page.", " · 业务任务：": " · Business task:", "这条对话使用所属助手或应用的配置。这里可查看当前能力及上次实际运行情况。": "This conversation uses its assistant or application settings. Review current capabilities and the last execution here.", " · 浏览器语音，跳过代码块": " · Browser speech; code blocks skipped", "[诊断内容已截断]": "[Diagnostic content truncated]", "响应较大，保留前 32 KiB；后续内容未读取。": "Large response: only the first 32 KiB were read and retained.", "未记录请求正文、认证头或上传内容。常见密钥字段已遮盖；响应文本仍可能包含业务信息。": "Request bodies, authentication headers and uploads are not recorded. Common secret fields are masked; response text may still contain business data.", "请求未收到 HTTP 响应：": "No HTTP response received:", "可能是网络中断、服务不可达或浏览器拦截；浏览器未提供服务端状态。操作是否已执行需要核对，未自动重发。": "The network, service or browser may have blocked the request. No server status is available. Verify whether the action ran before retrying; it was not resent automatically.", "响应读取中断：": "Response reading interrupted:", "这是 Codex 运行事件，不代表页面到 RunDesk 的 HTTP 请求返回了同样的状态。": "This is a Codex runtime event, not necessarily the status of the browser's HTTP request to RunDesk.", "上次记录": "Last recorded", " · 运行环境": " · Runtime", "固定版本": "Pinned version", "部署于": "Deployed at", " · 镜像与构建": " · Images & builds", "固定 Image ID · ": "Pinned image ID · ", "只读轨迹工具仅用于此分析会话；沿用原配置的模型与认证。原任务单独运行。": "Read-only trace tools are scoped to this analysis conversation, using the original model and authentication. The original task runs separately.", "total 是累计用量，last 是最近一轮的用量；均不代表完整上下文快照。耗时包含启动和等待审批。": "total is cumulative usage; last is usage for the latest turn. Neither is a full context snapshot. Duration includes startup and approval waits.", "例如 project-guide": "e.g. project-guide", "例如 filesystem": "e.g. filesystem", "已有密钥以 [redacted] 隐藏，保留它可沿用原值。MCP 命令在运行 Codex 的主机上执行。": "Existing secrets appear as [redacted]; keep this marker to retain their values. MCP commands run on the Codex host.", "合并导入，保留其他服务。env/http_headers 的密钥会隐藏；新环境需要补充。参数和 URL 中的敏感内容仍需自行检查。": "Merge while preserving other servers. Secrets in env/http_headers are masked and must be supplied in a new environment. Review arguments and URLs for sensitive data.", "检查工作区读写、Codex、沙箱实际执行及 App Server 接口，不调用模型。": "Check workspace access, Codex, sandbox execution and app-server interfaces without invoking a model.", "单用户后台；workspace-write 沙箱、on-request 审批。浏览器关闭后任务继续；后台退出则中断当前运行。": "Tasks use the configured sandbox and approval policy. Closing the browser does not stop work; stopping the server interrupts active runs.", "模型与认证页可查看登录状态和登录命令。模型在创建会话时确定。": "See Model & authentication for sign-in status and commands. The model is chosen when creating a conversation.", "删除此会话及 RunDesk 事件记录？原生 Codex 线程、上传文件和产物会保留。": "Delete this conversation and its RunDesk events? Native Codex threads, uploads and outputs will remain.", "例如：视觉助手": "e.g. Vision assistant", "点击读取当前实例的登录状态。": "Read the sign-in status for this configuration.", "当前实例": "Current configuration", "独立 Codex 配置目录；此实例可以在多个工作区创建会话。": "Separate Codex configuration directory; conversations can use multiple workspaces.", "默认实例沿用启动 RunDesk 时的 CODEX_HOME 和原有会话。": "The default configuration uses the service's CODEX_HOME and existing conversations.", "实例名称": "Configuration name", "新会话默认模型": "Default model for new conversations", "已读取模型，选择后保存实例": "Models loaded. Select one and save the configuration.", "保存实例": "Save configuration", "实例已保存；权限将在下一轮生效，默认模型用于新会话": "Saved. Permissions apply next turn; the default model applies to new conversations.", "配置目录：": "Configuration directory:", "会话创建后固定绑定实例与工作区。实例共用本机操作系统用户；全局技能、项目文件和服务环境变量仍可能共享。": "Conversations are bound to their configuration and workspace. Native configurations share the OS account; global skills, project files and service environment variables may also be shared.", "登录与重新加载": "Sign in & reload", "新实例需要配置凭据。请以运行后台的系统用户，在终端执行对应命令；登录完成后重新加载空闲连接。": "Configure credentials under the service's OS account using the command below, then reload idle connections.", "Ubuntu / macOS 登录命令": "Ubuntu / macOS sign-in command", "Windows PowerShell 登录命令": "Windows PowerShell sign-in command", "如后台使用 --codex 指定可执行文件，请将命令中的 codex 替换为该路径。凭据存储由 Codex 管理；使用系统密钥环时不保证账号隔离。": "Replace codex with your configured executable path if needed. Codex manages credential storage; an OS keychain does not guarantee account isolation.", "重新加载空闲连接": "Reload idle connections", "新建实例": "New configuration", "创建独立配置目录，然后在 Skills 和 MCP 页配置这个助手。": "Create a separate configuration directory, then configure Skills and MCP.", "创建并切换": "Create and switch", "已创建实例：": "Configuration created:", "网络中断，提交状